        en: "In official Huawei instructions, no transfer path to Health Connect is described, while FitMesh's code contains no direct integration with Huawei services. As a result, metrics recorded on Huawei devices (such as steps, sleep, heart rate, SpO2, and calories) do not flow automatically into Health Connect or FitMesh, and any reliance on external bridge tools must be evaluated case by case.",
